# Page loading gate (RIFT)

Every player-facing **MAP** page must load the site-wide boot overlay immediately after viewport metrics:

```html
<script src="rift-viewport-metrics.js?v=universal-viewport-1"></script>
<script src="rift-page-loading-gate.js?v=page-loading-gate-1"></script>
```

## Behavior

- Shows a dark full-page cover and **Loading game...** if loading takes longer than ~120ms.
- Baseline: holds until `window` `load`, then releases.
- Long async boots: `RoyalArmiesPageLoadingGate.retain('reason')` / `await release('reason')`, or `trackBoot(async () => { ... })`.
- Opt out (automation, headless render): `<body data-ra-page-loading="off">`.

## Events

- `royalarmies:page-loading-retain` — `detail: { reason }`
- `royalarmies:page-loading-release` — `detail: { reason }`

Bump `rift-page-loading-gate.js?v=` when changing the script (Cloudflare cache rule).
